# Rescue Skiff: "When this Spacecraft enters, return target creature or enchantment card from your graveyard to the
# battlefield." Faithless Looting draws Ornithopter and Rest in Peace and discards both, so the graveyard holds Black Lotus
# and Faithless Looting (artifact, sorcery: not legal targets, the refusals) beside the creature card and the enchantment
# card. Bot1 targets the Ornithopter, which returns untapped (CR 400.3); the Rest in Peace stays in the graveyard.
# The mana: Ruby pays Looting; Lotus's {W}{W}{W}, Pearl, Jet and Sapphire pay {5}{W}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Faithless Looting
Rescue Skiff
Ornithopter
Rest in Peace
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

